# ailocal local runtime

This Codex client runs against local Ollama models through the ailocal LiteLLM
proxy at `http://localhost:4000`. No cloud calls are made.

Use capability aliases, never raw backend model tags. The active profile and
generated capability catalog are authoritative for available roles, model
selection, context input, and maximum output. Do not rely on static values in
this file.

## Repository instructions

When the active repository contains `AGENTS.md`, read and follow it as the
repository operating contract. A more deeply nested `AGENTS.md` applies within
its directory scope.

This runtime preload does not restate repository coding standards, test
commands, architecture, or documentation policy.

## Tool boundary

The bundled research MCP provides external web search with explicit site and
provider scope. Native dispatch was measured on Codex 0.163.0 through the local
proxy. Other MCP servers require separate validation before registration.
Use filesystem and shell tools for repository code.

## Context discipline

Local inference has lower effective context and tool-call throughput than
hosted models. Prefer targeted discovery, bounded command output, and small
verifiable changes. Stop gathering context once the repository contract and
relevant implementation are understood.
